  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<div class=\"post-section\">\n<article class=\"post-31420 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-latest-jobs ast-article-single\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has recently published the notification for the recruitment of Food Analyst Posts on the official website. This recruitment has been issued for 10 posts. Online applying process for Bihar BTSC Food Analyst Recruitment 2026 has started on 20 May 2026 &amp; the candidates can apply until 19 June 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for Bihar BTSC Food Analyst Recruitment 2026 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Technical Services Commission (BTSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar BTSC Food Analyst Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">BTSC Advt No: 24/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>20 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>19 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>19 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For All Candidates : <strong>Rs 100/-&nbsp;</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar BTSC Food Analyst Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>37 Years (Male)&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years (Female UR, BC, EBC Male &amp; Female)&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>42 Years (SC, ST Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bihar BTSC Instructor Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar BTSC Food Analyst 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Posts : 10 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.4752%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.4752%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Food Analyst</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">03</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BC Female</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">0</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0577%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.467%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">0</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar BTSC Instructor Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor’s / Master’s / PhD in Chemistry, Microbiology, Food Technology, Biotechnology, Dairy Technology, Agricultural Science, Animal Science, Fisheries Science, Food Safety, Food &amp; Nutrition, Oil Technology, or related fields from a recognized Indian university with 3 years’ food analysis experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must also qualify the FSSAI Food Analyst Examination, New Delhi.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar BTSC Food Analyst Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the BTSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other  Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for Bihar BTSC Food Analyst recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar BTSC Food Analyst Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</tab