ilable in the important links above.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><strong>Q. What is BTSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of BTSC is https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
